Summon a Dread of level [44, 46, 48, 50, 52 (TL1-5; LVL 50)] that will annoyingly blink around, hexing your foes.

It knows the following spells:

*  Burning Hex at level [1, 2, 3, 4, 5 (TL1-5)]
*  Empathic Hex at level [1, 2, 3, 4, 5 (TL1-5)]
*  Pacification Hex at level [1, 2, 3, 4, 5 (TL1-5)]
*  Blur Sight at level [3, 4, 5, 6, 7 (TL1-5)]
*  Phase Door at level [1, 2, 3, 4, 5 (TL1-5)]
